{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7981daf14509f8a21abdf9c1a1630f1ef6b98838327916825c25c8fe70150a",
      "text": "我们就是“男极〇〇〇〇”！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:688c863294709830df3b538d03ce7cdf284a8be06e7f27ac4c84dcec368adae7",
      "text": "5人决定出演前男极联赛主办方举办的\n大型LIVE。预想到了对方会进行妨碍，\n各自采取的“对策”是……随后，\nLIVE当天，决战时刻终于到来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde9ae20a545cf305d5f25c2458465af716321b2fb89ec28902eb9a21ab4d67f",
      "text": "第10话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7981daf14509f8a21abdf9c1a1630f1ef6b98838327916825c25c8fe70150a",
      "text": "我们就是“男极〇〇〇〇”！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:411257f456d8bfd025cb5c3800804cd762bba54e1338a33d77765b9c23627308",
      "text": "现在开始，为了迎战前男极主办方举办的\n大型LIVE，召开研讨会议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f7c6f8e9ad71c38a338c491c4c4029bb8cc2f3ce6ddfdac0fa93236cf7201b",
      "text": "希望各位畅所欲言。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:445c377854f0ed80c661ddf7569f43e4273a3ba7315304249574b0b5267e9282",
      "text": "今天的练习虽然挺顺利，\n但问题是当天对方会怎么出招，对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a53240000b9f1a6c4563122a5db4c3d4792a8a887838a8ecb9fa584c90a424a7",
      "text": "毕竟那男人向来都会对\n自己看不顺眼的对手百般阻挠啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce114f38dea6e9bd71ae889da8ad0e3574f82dc03b3071fa6823d0f0ef4d30e0",
      "text": "这次也不知道会发生什么。必须预想会受到\n各种各样的妨碍，提前制定好对策才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2b1e2246d84ad286862fa2423f4363099120b2dfda6dd3bc767eafd61e194a",
      "text": "……先由我来说可以吗？\n关于当天的出行，我有一个提议！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000112:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbd8cd8f012082d6b23d14a456be8208fe6e19d6f626e6aa07703d992a956fb9",
      "text": "（今天的训练也顺利结束了。趁现在，\n先检查一下训练服和演出服装吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646f1b991276553482d6df4b3668484e549173691fd260961bffd0baa9ffd3ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9ca969b5c6d00edc3f1d71f5f0c3430bbe1d6db50558a7878429539b6e8bc1",
      "text": "嗯？那是……\n全都有破损或者开线了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:226addf9b74c7f806b1ef8da5a787a3a9d63a31e9e978c15113bedebfff5434a",
      "text": "这正是大家在训练中竭尽全力的证明！\n在LIVE之前会修补好的，请放心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2b1e2246d84ad286862fa2423f4363099120b2dfda6dd3bc767eafd61e194a",
      "text": "……先由我来说可以吗？\n关于当天的出行，我有一个提议！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8807641d846c0452876fc3ab7d6cccfd859966d797bb9992ed496a8754de80b5",
      "text": "（……没错。我也一定还有\n能够帮到大家的地方！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6af28ff5b8dcb2940d97f144efab4f28463fa4bddc01ecb0b59fb789b880b78e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n修补服装的事，能不能交给我？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c82e887cb37ead7c478e2aa1a99990f77e68830d38024e8c5864c39c1d6432e",
      "text": "还有……不只是修补，\n稍微改动一下可以吗？比如说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000033:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "LIVE当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46695c9cf7e7f4860b52b49cd23692e9c57a1f41648c7aaeaa2d5c4f0f0905d0",
      "text": "是315 Production的大巴对吧。\n能否请在这边的停车场稍作等待？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f8d1c6e60e1c742b789bd5c817bd8aeff93ebf47015817319f9ff7af562a95",
      "text": "实际上现场还没做好接纳相关人员的准备……\n请在这里再待命30分钟，不，40分钟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52a4b5f777c15f767e5ced778f3b97298d4dcfd56ff81f2fca82527e1e446575",
      "text": "哎哎，怎么这样！\n这可怎么办啊，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc6d6d9a328aedaa7d58a285ec1174079025631f47a038c76a23e68de4083e80",
      "text": "这下伤脑筋了呢。\n本来前面的路就容易堵车……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4401e0c4d6bb3351b763c91acb1ac42b43a23b28f5643396b5ab250ad37c9937",
      "text": "（但是……不管被拖延多少分钟都没问题。\n因为这辆大巴，只是诱饵而已！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284359ff83c10ad0fe01e6ed751c2c53a10db2b1c54c7840739483599bf4c357",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー来联络了！\n看来315 Pro的大巴果然被拦住了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e51226af19f219f55bf9d37801ca4a69d8bf38a162d527428ad8892e4a29356",
      "text": "不过按计划，他们俩替我们引开了敌人的视线。\n趁现在，我们赶去舞台那边吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3dba1e5f95ebe696c55ae0740e1e9451d8beed28fe1df91325ea937eb0100e",
      "text": "接下来是转弯处啊。\n硲先生，后面没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4023c51c6729b87c283c1a97ba972d53cebdd829f2a2cea33d4076c4645ca405",
      "text": "嗯，没有问题。\n葛之叶君，安全驾驶技术真漂亮！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f201e918e077e8e2390f4417bf7b69a9bdddddcf616f3187aca8572829e5098e",
      "text": "次郎，没事吧？\n对对，抓紧我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d0dcb45720ed9d499cf1ad759f7d7a592259a506405a0df68a5d7225c3f828",
      "text": "明明道路拥堵，而且还绕了远路，\n却一直在不断靠近会场呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baa0ecd7d5843273708a2fe6c3c1acbc550b66a95bf88f0b0ec0feefcb752cd2",
      "text": "呵呵。首先第一关，突破了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a4303db7fe09d9351374a94027b0ddf18354118a15353877c71dac0430b084b",
      "text": "呼。总算平安抵达会场了，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:371593459d6350044195fd418f814fdfe75fdc854ad5661b2383eceeb655fd8f",
      "text": "……从大家的装束来看，各自为这次LIVE\n准备的对策似乎都很万全呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0a9bbc25cf9fd20348e0c2a9adce95bfd562b7de4e2c5dc991d755c129bf9bc",
      "text": "不只是实先生。\n每个人都准备好了自己力所能及的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4876b3fd4e2293a9f34fbff3982b1e2c048e86c8324bd77069c7361aa8d68d5",
      "text": "这样的话，不论前路有什么艰难险阻，\n都不足为惧！……好，走吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000100:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2df2e2af8c7f665cbe296da4e2f00b830e13ad66727a280bbdd6448cd375363",
      "text": "会、会场也太大了……不如说走了这么久\n怎么还没到休息室。难道说，这也是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7a77f5816ed21d5ba860a5f492820102f37198de89c289fd57a54e470f82e76",
      "text": "啊，又有指引路标的告示！我看看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d6dfef3402163fbdb76757e57a619696a441766299ae612d42f16b7308ae224",
      "text": "“315 Production的休息室，\n还是在刚才的地方右拐！”吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac50090d3752281fdd11382d8daa59d89bc0f0d9badb3a1a96daa86c1cf6acbf",
      "text": "中途开始就觉得古怪了……\n没错了，这也是对方的妨碍啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b615057b64ae5c2ac2eb7fc7ac00dfb15a2666276d9082014226df6a9fe1fb9c",
      "text": "得想办法去休息室才行！\n咦？在那边的是……工作人员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c880a29851cf7a1374dc4e76d4f72eff247453e3f08999ce5988aa527c71b8d5",
      "text": "不好意思！请问能告诉我们\n315 Production的休息室在哪里吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959755c8fb7e38325a45d7018c9456b9f2647bf7d587d3dffe2e30f59c20acda",
      "text": "哎，你、你们是……！\n抱歉，我们不能告诉你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae42cf79298f89c14d6049bd5b0693a1adba06cdc7edffc52e80c60d92b07d6a",
      "text": "上面严厉交代过，\n绝对不能给315 Pro带路……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000204:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a7fdadc93f9a32ef0a16675261bc48b5d3eebb5eab3af59a0bfca031197b94",
      "text": "……好——嘞。各位，这里就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000220:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e313a7487e335a443c3fae160d0619cc79e860ed74ac249809b2e1e2ad7060e7",
      "text": "唔。在这里能看到山下君准备的\n对策了吗……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000225:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90443e9d8f1113476fd7c58dd30bfe88cb6b78e8754a2f560f9178ddfff3599a",
      "text": "我从刚才起就很在意了！你这身打扮。\n次郎，你打算怎么做？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000243:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd162662cec83274712844d5038430c54cce1adeb49cbb5b3ee8969067ab8524",
      "text": "我啊，为了今天、为了这种时刻……变成了猫！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_c:cmd-000278:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f202e496c1c0653cfbff31901851d0179ec94d95491b83c442798a696bff8c",
      "text": "“猫”……？\n原来如此。真有想法啊，山下君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c66f33600883b818883d5cdfd4d840a6bf57823db3759f3fb527b9871298b90",
      "text": "据说猫咪具有归巢本能。\n也就是说，只要变成猫咪……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c54ada4ac12607f7f1401e6b51f5239f76f0199ea52d8b41251eb1f89d334d0f",
      "text": "无论遇到何种妨碍，都能抵达堪称我们第二个家的\n休息室和舞台……是这个意思吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0f9296a396c6decb7ed43d31f759fda176406dee48babe7b7d1430aeb2434a",
      "text": "不，完全不是。\n我是去拍了可爱的猫咪照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5310c9d8e5289366040ce3b040aacf3edaf17315d8f41f62bcf64e5b35e0c7f",
      "text": "想着在像这种“紧要关头”时，\n搞不好能拿来当贿赂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e3b5c52f554ee6f19784d50c0a5428eafba71a00c96659227f654db8f509cda",
      "text": "那么，这身打扮又是怎么回事？是山下先生的兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d900d4db65e3c9c5263be109257f00b3c00f39be322920767d9e6eb440ec0e1b",
      "text": "不是啦不是啦，是我自己想尽办法拍好照片、\n努力尝试的结果啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000081:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:831e96faed8f9c077a1e5d0a03e6926275ae76fb3589018b5b06d7d8f67af4f9",
      "text": "来～看这边？\n对对，真乖呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:997de17fa707ddebc3140cdbf515e31b4bbfecb19f6403b36bc943a3455f2db6",
      "text": "啊～糊掉了……\n突然动了一下，吓到它了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:301dfe12aa57505fba6c69ece243536e88ca9206092ca87a8e946dbafe09f0ff",
      "text": "（……话说回来，\n渡边先生真是个靠得住的男人啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad0ec958f0c44ff4630d706b6ec309f681a19e3e0bd1f7fb152f747abcc2d1d",
      "text": "（说什么“当天骑摩托车去会场吧！\n我来开路！”之类的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44391ca8a95330286b8c3e7be0e63460f66f50ad5025951b3c791a028df15e3c",
      "text": "（我能做到的事，顶多也就是午睡或者\n做做广播体操的程度……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:824cec68ca190e11e72f3645e1fa96fb4159cf6b364d1115ffc02c8e8faf98fc",
      "text": "（猫很厉害！只要借助猫的力量，\n当天肯定能在什么地方派上用场的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0e0e93b5df4555d25165445a7fd6d388a4262b3662101ac579f2721a0819e45",
      "text": "山下先生，拍到好照片了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cce363e1f742fb99110000e9b3c561605a0c6b5548bf7594ce5f794a4f0a195",
      "text": "哎呀，还是不太行……\n有没有什么好办法呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a78985e69e3709a76c464f3fb0d1df908ae374e74b464ee97e97f008a5a80774",
      "text": "既然这样，试着体会一下猫的心情如何？\n不介意的话，我可以把这个借给您哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a",
      "text": "哎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac72c2e82931e8ca2a1cd74b763b5aa30e0f39e518455d0db6cad5828b772b7f",
      "text": "（不不不，这也是为了能帮上大家。\n哪顾得上害臊啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_d:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64a433d477ec22279be0fa873a959482156554b84664c74ec10f843c6f0fb8d7",
      "text": "来，猫咪酱。再来一张！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f253ab991bf396a1a4ab9421a05fdc3cb29ddef3284dd83cb63c8412ed6ad5a7",
      "text": "来～看，是可爱的猫咪照片哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e310cba846eef32c530b4de7a7a120bea3d9ae234dc1f9e8bf1a416743669cc",
      "text": "这、这是……！\n居然在这种场合亮出猫来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:936152b0ff5aa06783f58c777f0de9f5a76aac4371df0435924a6f0149b88c87",
      "text": "虽然不能违抗上面的指示……但猫太可爱了！\n看着猫的样子身心放松下来，忍不住吐露心声了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae8b7ec7d9a3e5a013347bc8cf115bdd1280f97e51972774e7d7e9e30dc52d1",
      "text": "……其实我们，也很想为\n一同支撑着男极的315 Pro加油打气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a225c5eb482aca02c88c849a39692c860e250ade2ef00c29f7e7499c316a109",
      "text": "我们豁出去了。\n带各位去休息室！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f8010431433a3eb7e4b790e02903ff4344a4f70a54614bc86dfabb7d7463eb",
      "text": "居然能接二连三地收买工作人员，\n猫的力量还真是伟大啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baec56791d267c6b8bfff65206e0c14a24d7b7c13eb1102e5332ab758c02a6bd",
      "text": "休息室就在拐过那个弯角的地方呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf6fa2fccca06304c271c615ff7d2e083fc46b269a742c2d6f77ca07f0821fb1",
      "text": "各位，这次真的要到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a865fe7fbf1456bfb933150083ad2a0bc8873cd437109ea594bcc78b69fc9d57",
      "text": "且慢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184a63bd485ccc557f3c303d1b066bec82a22bb5a1d6ea421251d91c96609c7a",
      "text": "！？你们是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7efe9924eb6c233f95d59f277f6805d910641bc89e0616897ae558cf6d70482",
      "text": "亏你们能走到这里啊，315 Production。\n但是，从这里开始休想通过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c372ba95bdc253400c1ba8f5ae22124357fb41fa58a6e3b9f1742ce4663de3ac",
      "text": "不好意思，我们跟其他工作人员不同，\n最讨厌的就是315 Production了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:113df8249994e24ba007ce6a07eb23ef7a99940a8289943809a754adb1f3edf2",
      "text": "呜……休息室明明就在眼前了。\n到底该怎么办才好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af31be474b1bf2796db235891d4607996346ee701729995c4058f1d05f72f76e",
      "text": "……看来该轮到我们出场了啊，硲先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_e:cmd-000197:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a905b6208ad2a42b35e084809b4917591a7cab6aeca55120709ff42797c4cf03",
      "text": "道夫先生，还有雨彦！难道说，\n现在要告诉我们那身同款打扮的含义了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:037f33dbdf1dd879eea71f59c3dc02eeda7be38f1a9f6aa120a6925c87a575f5",
      "text": "嚯，挺不错的嘛。\n用这个的话，高处的大扫除也……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6ca02f42ed0579fd6c191b461b53756c7b41bd3e31f4735cd29bc2a83939758",
      "text": "葛之叶君，真巧啊。\n你也是来看清扫用具的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c9979d3942570bc2cfaf1d0fd3c9ac1c995bee23a33becdf1ca10488c81bf4",
      "text": "是啊，我本来就是干保洁的。\n这次也想着用这个出一份力。硲先生呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5115731e10a644eccc1aeb7f2c6e0ebbe805b442b90956ef8c987fac460e942c",
      "text": "我是觉得除了数学之外，作为爱好的打扫\n或许也能派上用场，才来到这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:243fc3d8bfa1a5746804d4e7e0896938a947704c2391e9444edc9c44f011cf2d",
      "text": "但是，应该避免对策重复吗。\n这里还是交给专业人士……哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec62a97435800c94e30a4422fb6dbbd4dbbc0550fe292ad4584723cd7669c36c",
      "text": "……葛之叶君。据说这世上，\n存在着一种名为“双子穿搭”的事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fb40c1b4f8bdda7fa5b2bf7bc072da761295078006432eae8216b0c2d306b0b",
      "text": "似乎是一种通过将外表搭配得如同双胞胎一般，\n进一步衬托彼此的风尚文化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba20945120dcc93ca0438ec88732dfb45cdfd54cdc2666454ff4a36973a95622",
      "text": "若你不介意，我们要不要以“双子穿搭”\n来迎战这次的LIVE？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ebd42fcbf55e559e62f675f5dc07765feed60d44cfbe89f586ed21da49e3713",
      "text": "嚯。虽然对那种文化完全搞不懂，\n但要是跟硲先生联手，打扫起来确实会更顺手吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61c7a68e42e058d9c3430a5f82427e1b9f1ce3a48a62cb3dadd71cff68d31a6d",
      "text": "说起来……无论我们\n流了多少汗结束练习，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee5e990283c8f0b2b2823737e5c6e8a7051ab370a5a86ca00ff6d8af5124773",
      "text": "到了第二天，不论是事务所还是练习室，\n连一点汗水和污渍的痕迹都没留下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014ad60d375bbbf4af975d52a3e1a42093f632dff9b41cb6b41fd50f42640798",
      "text": "原来是你们两个打扫过了吗……！\n托你们的福，每天都能神清气爽地投入练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df18284eb8c0ab930892a812f56270a374a3922e0052477a8587e1150d5a394",
      "text": "整理好环境，头脑与心灵也会随之梳理整齐。\n这就是清扫的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4279cbd807379ccefb3871e681242c86d7f19c8407f99c468359c359b37e03f",
      "text": "来吧，挡路的二位。\n接下来，该对你们进行大扫除了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c0a65f5f5fcf54ec0fc1be86ef8253122b5d6a901927f2e0bf90ffd4374c40",
      "text": "就由我们这对双子穿搭的清洁工，\n来化解你们那僵硬凝固的头脑与心灵吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f62aabe4b4bf2f0c044f929e1a358d8e5027553dc19f233be00796fd822185",
      "text": "首先……\n能跟我们谈谈，为何如此讨厌我们吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f618c42c61824079010926d700a4682486fcb43f8730fcedd039f8c83ede0753",
      "text": "那还用说吗！\n因为我们想在这个行业里独霸一方啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fc98f8e003a8c4d8fa464d919a0543f01baf76a14abeaa5c7eabe568741055a",
      "text": "爬到现在这个地位，\n好不容易能随心所欲了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:237aa5dec6563a341e820ba6a856c47c94ac9ca4256ea7e7229b38bc724bb0be",
      "text": "你们这种新人要是摆出一副了不起的样子，\n我们的立场不就危险了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b69ed31b2297d13dfbe581fcf7710d7008c219704a28ea0594c1975d16aaceae",
      "text": "原来如此。\n守护自己的容身之所，确实很重要。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba80a0eedec0446dc105ce71a514000c87ebb7e9b0632456aea2106ffcda33f6",
      "text": "但是，止步于原地、\n不再前行真的好吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66d3079e18738c3f9d03fa24f4859582c7fc6698d65e7d731394762fc2f226b4",
      "text": "你们是否过度执着于眼前的事物，\n从而忽略了自己内心真正想做的事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da30667c733db915f17628f363ec7c15fe8c26eb26eceaad53597a0a1ac0235b",
      "text": "这……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2c12c134d2aaa25801171d7513324e691ea150ff674c7584a1238fd0db366f9",
      "text": "坐上高位、随心所欲、\n被所有人捧着，确实感觉很爽。可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f31b23b5e1013167846e79358bb864efb8fa292c26bbcf0932253a2f08ca1e8",
      "text": "说实话，比起那些东西，\n我们更想看到偶像们绽放出耀眼的光芒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09e51816ca58636a8081af9efc71960dd0ff5b8064b15b0c6cdf6fc04fc22be0",
      "text": "是啊。我们……\n是因为最喜欢偶像，才进入这个行业的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f604d9aa38888f7b2270523a6c7319d2a3d1c5267c310cd9851e52c5e405ed41",
      "text": "既然这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64826b5ae9974d272657f2532d514b0369998d64cb931ab17079a04e2a073e49",
      "text": "你们不想看看，在你们举办的男极中\n获得了超群成长的我们所带来的舞台吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a26a8d271f4de5afe229ace39d3bb7e828101e5876c32f82b52197a0452d62c0",
      "text": "比任何奢华都更让人陶醉的、\n偶像这一存在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d558bac2e0587a87e43707c2ebac2973338ed5b941c49e75193a1b3df35ee8c",
      "text": "我们会再一次，让你们彻底迷上的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14fff86eb22414fb57600d8331e9863a9bfcb7d6d79d9dba566d38bbb44ffa06",
      "text": "总算赶到休息室了呢。\n在演出开始前，快换上演出服吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39cc817f8d68c152f16c3211b60341cdc81ce04718de08e9a8581bd838b7f928",
      "text": "哎呀，服装上别着个相当可爱的小玩意呢？\n这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d278ab439c6efb011956367f3303ccf20d842e93d24d7cb897da42fc0526a2a1",
      "text": "啊哈哈……这是我自己准备的对策之一。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6e1bc9b77c510ed91805d763bf28ff09af699c06eb0cbf1ab1e809cb005510a",
      "text": "送给在男极期间坚持努力的我们自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b2ba956cf7d96ac982e02264da363e50e4eb6a20f85ced60ba419cedf50a778",
      "text": "为了嘉奖这份拼搏、鼓舞士气，\n亲手制作的“奖励奖牌”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45ca4a868d7fe35bfd457aedcf5897ab440225fa952c263bd343798eaf2c7b21",
      "text": "哇，正中间还写了字。\n我看看，“男极”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e041b2a04001c8e3adb3c86a740370361f60f72e545896b1ab8ba99243e585d",
      "text": "“男极FIVE”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4ebef2f37c60513dea37554da74ac65bf6cc0c52bb49b3fa86d1dab0a832a5",
      "text": "因为不能写“男极KING”，所以我想了个替代的\n称号，并和制作人商量了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d517ab3d5954d781c34d1c60744790d52de263fdfa993a7f6a621be11f4baa",
      "text": "感觉像英雄战队的名字一样，很帅气吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a55cb64fee4e6179bdab567f742a516fd45850574bf59d7a93e2cb4c3df1e962",
      "text": "要是演出服又没送达，\n我本来还打算从零开始做一套的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:526f5e1730a4c4fff7b3cc7a1989cbdaed9003c10312bd4fcdeee8191cec656a",
      "text": "幸好没用上，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00b437fe9c0f44a27eb593c92ac5d5227c3b1e6fc0e5af2510f98f202e3ef3df",
      "text": "啊哈哈，所以诚司刚才才穿着围裙啊？\n真的是，这5个人也太靠得住啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000227:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e72b612a1a391ac0e139c86a3b10afbd0111137731d71c1877c52701d03addba",
      "text": "LIVE会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000233:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae5c5462c685fc917f103b9c2eb59b001653591ce50674f64261fb6325c74b8",
      "text": "哎呀，气氛越来越热烈了！\n那么现在，请下一组出演者登场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000235:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78469b869fda6aa9b35216a88b46db37227e7d790fff585bed52dab782b9ffff",
      "text": "在男极联赛中，既不是男极KING……也不是别的什么，\n而是男极优秀奖？男极努力奖？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000239:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02698a19872b30c3dd14f9e1bf1b0a0f605144b1578d586465a4dadf6983db01",
      "text": "荣获了这般奖项的，正是315 Production的各位～！\n咦，怎么迟迟不上台呢？是迟到了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000247:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78073b7bb426b00424ab6e96d7d54c83b49f0ce499e5fa90be073f0e8f0175b1",
      "text": "（呵呵呵，这帮家伙怎么可能上得了台！\n现在肯定还在为我准备的重重妨碍苦苦挣扎呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000259:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aa71adba142539128d582d21c011dc147e3137a0bc608a3b4be75e7914f9391",
      "text": "我们的话，就在这里哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000271:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8ce9639f364d6b79385b85499b3103c1a4a13132c74f1b400f8eb2ccff67a78",
      "text": "什、什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ecf8c3dc6ccb53f8988848de88651e7e7e0a8634a4011fe3268ec124f301521",
      "text": "（怎、怎、为什么315 Production会在这里！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f44174db8f6accf618ad2a129f687241d9e090a1fafc8dcc12ce377aade3e30a",
      "text": "……诚然我们既不是男极KING，也没什么了不起。\n但托男极联赛的福，我们是获得了成长的偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f05de1b0f9e93dcab05b9bb2a1b3eba8092e8b1dc5794a19e4ddd86d7057e4e4",
      "text": "所以，我们要自报名号。\n我们就是……男极FIVE！全员，出动！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcdeda96b0753d7ef56037c658443da18f83cdee165448fb019518f6a94f333",
      "text": "（正是。男极教会了我们）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5b0decbc010e21abf0ef8cb78cf76e640071aefb43a677c3074f076cc38b892",
      "text": "（在偶像的世界里，无论自己多少岁，\n都能找到让人热血沸腾、有趣至极的东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000239:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ef76d90248202f47a8c425d452ad54655a36c5eb4e2b933b6a4bfaed183cece",
      "text": "（只要心怀梦想与希望，还有志同道合的同伴，\n就能永远绽放光彩，无论多远都能奔跑下去！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000309:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41c5cc1ff7d77d502bcc2b7e04d6906160870e0a5e489121710f24ecca206d5a",
      "text": "（这样由偶像一步步走出的轨迹，\n必定能化作照亮人们明日的光芒吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000372:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53502faf0903a76cfdbaaf2902f018097ae699162bca817debc94ba1a19f27f1",
      "text": "（没错，就由我们来呈现！\n为大家的未来注入闪耀光芒的最棒舞台！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_i:cmd-000395:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8f3cc66cb732430c3e8b0f179bc3efd178e6e14256dabb96f2580e6e52cadf0",
      "text": "315 Production这群混蛋……！\n又给我坏事！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3711e3941b71fce4d78d8aaab629d5b53b4bcf3cd76508043f700295cc0ad363",
      "text": "（这一次，本该把竞争对手羞辱个痛快，\n展现我们砸下重金打造的奢华舞台……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73cf4b21837d3092970edaf172b60cec0718812358a9776478e20af0e31f3fef",
      "text": "（好让世人明白，只有我们才配得上顶点的地位才对……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83aae418bdbc477974f3ef3a84d2cea01ea39a4ba1be4a8699e7bbcc0558ca2f",
      "text": "……可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0920c31fb2ed3706c0624323a6d51560f9d2d78c13338760fa98187765326a44",
      "text": "我曾经渴望见到的顶尖偶像的身姿……\n真的是那样的东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22651f0fe3e7d7eb8ea40c2a1ef07e3f031ee2deea896ef5ef93ec6ae04e5b4c",
      "text": "……我不懂了。如今的我，或许已经既无法找寻，\n也无法亲手孕育出来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4aa1183c642a8d137ac7cbbc62481733ff316aee4c1ff7166579a1740aef348",
      "text": "……也是啊。顶尖偶像，究竟是什么？\n在场的每个人，恐怕都无法给出一个确切的解释吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3285e1b152b09bf94d01cf211d76facab07dcef39dca6e6dbed3ccfd0a2a6a",
      "text": "正因如此，大家或许才会在脑海中描摹、憧憬着那个身姿，\n并不顾一切地追逐着它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcbf16423b8b3d8717afe93015934d00f87f6bc274570d89d2f9b4554fe5b7dc",
      "text": "毕竟偶像的世界，\n就是充满着那么多梦想嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb179799112afba54225c03006ea4a37fab6c3d89e4ba8c88db0825e6396b7b2",
      "text": "怀抱同样梦想的人彼此扶持，\n一起去寻找那究竟是何种模样，好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6195fce4992d1e13ef1247d1612df72a72718066c49b934546860287d786efd1",
      "text": "信玄先生的肩膀可是很靠得住的哦～。大概就算我和\n另外两三个人一起骑上去，他也能轻轻松松带我们前行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c00bb672029662e3e9f6ee4f7b7c76d3b09ea5b4bc92a127ff68509aa74c8ce",
      "text": "呵呵。和这样充满力量、永不言弃、\n无论发生什么都会一直奔跑下去的我们315 Pro一起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1936de3fdf26f882a019f84ec6f0605f8b94b52e1751a9a1b171e31d6bb7b8c",
      "text": "让我们再次启程，\n去追逐顶尖偶像这个梦想吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a00dd7c292d0ad92c72dda454309a78e313be46670ce75a0cfbf5fa5eb0c9e",
      "text": "……竟然对身为敌人的我都伸出援手，\n真是群厚颜无耻到极点的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000218:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4977fa45d7caf5fc09d16d990b1da289faafa76fa01487a3d41ede7da60c8f87",
      "text": "不过，多亏你们，我醒悟过来了。……谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000252:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d1e1079d647135a0beea0c562ffbb2737e4b94129cd78fe963d879de4c655ff",
      "text": "LIVE结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000269:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c149aebf5f47af41c21fd994552353fdd8c567096aae7b8b81184bbafb1228bd",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n我们到庆功宴会场门前了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000271:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:491ecbae0e83dc29b1d6daf7daaf106030d746a99160e82b5e4b23b749c7fb2d",
      "text": "现在在这儿的是男极红和男极猫咪。还有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000273:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:777e4cae25fa0b87de4f58029a23f5b93805aa226249e8b340bdf70beaaf2c20",
      "text": "男极红是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000276:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd0ea74c18c4d10a96ed0cdbb82f3e2501a7777e7cf75fec50ea0927346da1f8",
      "text": "啊哈哈，就是那个啦。大家觉得“男极FIVE”\n听起来像英雄的名字，一下子就聊嗨了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000278:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca6184a85b9018a5fa3f22b1fb30e1a6bcbc3be27fda22ea23e2ccc35be842f",
      "text": "于是就给自己起了个外号，\n或者说是别称之类的代号。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000280:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:917a2ed3daec02552fedcaf129cd084294ebaa2e017e6b78ef34d04281feee06",
      "text": "我是男极红，次郎是男极猫咪。\n然后，还有男极肌肉缝纫机……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000282:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:640c7eafb203569b63697dde53678a739d43029148e0dbab1bd3610eaa61d66d",
      "text": "还有……啊，来了来了！\n男极清洁，还有男极清洁·眼镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000284:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7f41726421feabcc9b0a8824cb34cd9d2359f06d2b3e3c003c777610f1a60c",
      "text": "男极FIVE，全员集结！就这么回事啦。\n聚在路边也不太好，我们先去里面等你们哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000286:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d01291b51ff811fbb0fd82bdbb35a4f3b3544467d7a2c5838325d02b958321",
      "text": "你们当诱饵时候的事，\n我很期待听你们详细讲讲哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000288:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:130885c08f4390cf6621e0b24e10eaf75cdaa26183c0d22359032d5c57d381e1",
      "text": "我们也有好多事情\n想跟●●●●プロデューサー说呢。那，一会儿见咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000298:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b19cab6474e27cc24df0c0cf162678408df4b1e82d08723a3a4f554b83b5c7a6",
      "text": "第2章　拍上门来的挑战书！\n通往顶尖偶像之路　完",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
